{"game":"Kirby's Dream Land 3","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false"},{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"plando_connections","name":"Plando Connections","kind":"plando","doc":"Generic connections plando. Format is:\n- entrance: \"Entrance Name\"\n  exit: \"Exit Name\"\n  direction: \"Direction\"\n  percentage: 100\nDirection must be one of 'entrance', 'exit', or 'both', and defaults to 'both' if omitted.\nPercentage is an integer from 1 to 100, and defaults to 100 when omitted.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"default":[]},{"key":"total_heart_stars","name":"total_heart_stars","kind":"named_range","doc":"Deprecated. Use max_heart_stars instead. Supported for only one version.","weighted":true,"visibility":0,"min":5,"max":99,"default":-1,"special":{"default":-1}}]},{"name":"Goal Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"goal","name":"Goal","kind":"choice","doc":"Zero: collect the Heart Stars, and defeat Zero in the Hyper Zone.\nBoss Butch: collect the Heart Stars, and then complete the boss rematches in the Boss Butch mode.\nMG5: collect the Heart Stars, and then complete a perfect run through the minigame gauntlet within the Super MG5\nJumping: collect the Heart Stars, and then reach a designated score within the Jumping sub-game","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"zero","label":"Zero","id":0},{"value":"boss_butch","label":"Boss Butch","id":1},{"value":"mg5","label":"MG5","id":2},{"value":"jumping","label":"Jumping","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"zero"},{"key":"goal_speed","name":"Goal Speed","kind":"choice","doc":"Normal: the goal is unlocked after purifying the five bosses\nFast: the goal is unlocked after acquiring the target number of Heart Stars","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"normal","label":"Normal","id":0},{"value":"fast","label":"Fast","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"normal"},{"key":"max_heart_stars","name":"Max Heart Stars","kind":"range","doc":"Maximum number of heart stars to include in the pool of items.\nIf fewer available locations exist in the pool than this number, the number of available locations will be used instead.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":5,"max":99,"default":30},{"key":"heart_stars_required","name":"Required Heart Stars","kind":"range","doc":"Percentage of heart stars required to purify the five bosses and reach Zero.\nEach boss will require a differing amount of heart stars to purify.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"jumping_target","name":"Jumping Target Score","kind":"range","doc":"The required score needed to complete the Jumping minigame.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":25,"default":10}]},{"name":"World Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"remote_items","name":"Remote Items","kind":"toggle","doc":"Enables receiving items from your own world, primarily for co-op play.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"strict_bosses","name":"Strict Bosses","kind":"toggle","doc":"If enabled, one will not be able to move onto the next world until the previous world's boss has been purified.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"open_world","name":"Open World","kind":"toggle","doc":"If enabled, all 6 stages will be unlocked upon entering a world for the first time. A certain amount of stages\nwill need to be completed in order to unlock the bosses","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"ow_boss_requirement","name":"Open World Boss Requirement","kind":"range","doc":"The amount of stages completed needed to unlock the boss of a world when Open World is turned on.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":6,"default":3},{"key":"consumables","name":"Consumable-sanity","kind":"toggle","doc":"When enabled, adds all 1-Ups and Maxim Tomatoes as possible locations.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"starsanity","name":"Starsanity","kind":"toggle","doc":"When enabled, every star in a given stage will become a check.\nWill increase the possible filler pool to include 1/3/5 stars.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"filler_percentage","name":"Filler Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Percentage of non-required Heart Stars to be converted to filler items (1-Ups, Maxim Tomatoes, Invincibility Candy).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"trap_percentage","name":"Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Percentage of filler items to be converted to trap items (Gooey Bags, Slowness, Eject Ability).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"gooey_trap_weight","name":"Gooey Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Chance that any given trap is a Gooey Bag (spawns Gooey when you receive it).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"slow_trap_weight","name":"Slowness Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Chance that any given trap is Slowness (halves your max speed for 15 seconds when you receive it).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"ability_trap_weight","name":"Ability Trap Percentage","kind":"range","doc":"Chance that any given trap is an Eject Ability (ejects your ability when you receive it).","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":50},{"key":"stage_shuffle","name":"Stage Shuffle","kind":"choice","doc":"None: No stage shuffling.\nSame World: shuffles stages around their world.\nPattern: shuffles stages according to the stage pattern (stage 3 will always be a minigame stage, etc.)\nShuffled: shuffles stages across all worlds.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"none","label":"None","id":0},{"value":"same_world","label":"Same World","id":1},{"value":"pattern","label":"Pattern","id":2},{"value":"shuffled","label":"Shuffled","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"none"},{"key":"boss_shuffle","name":"Boss Shuffle","kind":"text_choice","doc":"None: Bosses will remain in their vanilla locations\nShuffled: Bosses will be shuffled amongst each other\nFull: Bosses will be randomized\nSingularity: All (non-Zero) bosses will be replaced with a single boss\nSupports plando placement.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"none","label":"None","id":0},{"value":"shuffled","label":"Shuffled","id":1},{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":2},{"value":"singularity","label":"Singularity","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"none"},{"key":"animal_randomization","name":"Animal Randomization","kind":"choice","doc":"Disabled: all animal positions will be vanilla.\nShuffled: all animal positions will be shuffled amongst each other.\nFull: random animals will be placed across the levels. At least one of each animal is guaranteed.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"disabled","label":"Disabled","id":0},{"value":"shuffled","label":"Shuffled","id":1},{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"disabled"},{"key":"copy_ability_randomization","name":"Copy Ability Randomization","kind":"choice","doc":"Disabled: enemies give regular copy abilities and health.\nEnabled: all enemies will have the copy ability received from them randomized.\nEnabled Plus Minus: enemies (except minibosses) can additionally give you anywhere from +2 health to -1 health when eaten.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"disabled","label":"Disabled","id":0},{"value":"enabled","label":"Enabled","id":1},{"value":"enabled_plus_minus","label":"Enabled Plus Minus","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"disabled"},{"key":"boss_requirement_random","name":"Randomize Purification Requirement","kind":"toggle","doc":"If enabled, boss purification will require a random amount of Heart Stars. Depending on options, this may have\nboss purification unlock in a random order.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"gifting","name":"Gifting","kind":"toggle","doc":"When enabled, the goal game item will be sent to other compatible games as a gift,\nand you can receive gifts from other players. This can be enabled during gameplay\nusing the client.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"}]},{"name":"Cosmetic Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"game_language","name":"Game Language","kind":"choice","doc":"The language that the game should display. This does not have to match the given rom.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"japanese","label":"Japanese","id":0},{"value":"english","label":"English","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"english"},{"key":"allow_bb","name":"Allow Boss Butch Bosses","kind":"choice","doc":"Allow Boss Butch variants of bosses in Boss Shuffle.\nEnabled: any boss placed will have a 50% chance of being the Boss Butch variant, including bosses not present\nEnforced: all bosses will be their Boss Butch variant.\nBoss Butch boss changes are only visual.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"disabled","label":"Disabled","id":0},{"value":"enabled","label":"Enabled","id":1},{"value":"enforced","label":"Enforced","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"disabled"},{"key":"kirby_flavor_preset","name":"Kirby Flavor","kind":"choice","doc":"The color of Kirby, from a list of presets.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"custom","label":"Custom","id":-1},{"value":"default","label":"Default","id":0},{"value":"bubblegum","label":"Bubblegum","id":1},{"value":"cherry","label":"Cherry","id":2},{"value":"blueberry","label":"Blueberry","id":3},{"value":"lemon","label":"Lemon","id":4},{"value":"kiwi","label":"Kiwi","id":5},{"value":"grape","label":"Grape","id":6},{"value":"chocolate","label":"Chocolate","id":7},{"value":"marshmallow","label":"Marshmallow","id":8},{"value":"licorice","label":"Licorice","id":9},{"value":"watermelon","label":"Watermelon","id":10},{"value":"orange","label":"Orange","id":11},{"value":"lime","label":"Lime","id":12},{"value":"lavender","label":"Lavender","id":13},{"value":"miku","label":"Miku","id":14}],"aliases":{},"default":"default"},{"key":"kirby_flavor","name":"Custom Kirby Flavor","kind":"dict","doc":"A custom color for Kirby. To use a custom color, set the preset to Custom and then define a dict of keys from \"1\" to\n\"15\", with their values being an HTML hex color.","weighted":false,"visibility":9,"default":{"1":"B018